{"id":"n91815-1-5","stage":2,"title":"알 · 粒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91815-1-5-1","ko":"이 약의 복용 방법을 알려 주세요.","zh":"请告诉我这种药的服用方法。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약의","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"복용","meaning":"服用","explanation":"복용：服用","readings":[{"term":"복용","audio":"/audio/e244c06c308a5238603e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59586","senseId":"1","lemma":"복용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방법을","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알려","meaning":"告知","explanation":"알리다：告知；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"알리다","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29770","senseId":"1","lemma":"알리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"e244c06c308a5238","term":"복용","zh":"服用","audio":"/audio/e244c06c308a5238603e.mp3","entryId":"59586","definition":"吃药。","pronunciation":["보굥"]},{"id":"a4a801d526fb2511","term":"방법","zh":"方法，办法","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3","entryId":"65531","definition":"处理某事的手段或方式。","pronunciation":["방법"]},{"id":"c8eae4fd8a7a21d5","term":"알리다","zh":"告知","audio":"/audio/c8eae4fd8a7a21d57d22.mp3","entryId":"29770","definition":"使醒悟或得知原本不知道或忘记的事情。","pronunciation":["알리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/149295417958bb929aa7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91815-1-5-2","ko":"매일 아침에 한 알씩 드시면 됩니다.","zh":"每天早上吃一颗就可以了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알씩","meaning":"粒，丸，颗，片","explanation":"알：粒，丸，颗，片；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"알","audio":"/audio/63251c05b0dbf37fa9f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91815","senseId":"1","lemma":"알","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드시면","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":